#: src/modules/views/conversion_mode_group.cr:35
msgid ""
"Decrease for more black.\n"
"66 is a good fit for colored docs.\n"
"For grayscaled documents 50-60 is\n"
"often a good choice."
msgstr ""
"Diminuer pour plus de noir.\n"
"66 convient bien aux documents en couleur.\n"
"Pour les documents en niveaux de gris, 50-60 est\n"
"souvent un bon choix."

